# Structure optimization only: the ropt_* jobs of 11_H2_theta0_B425.jobs, same settings, on their own node,
# so the optimized geometries come without waiting for the R scan (the scan is the independent check).
# Written by hand (not by tools/make_jobs.py).
COMMON B=425.5 k=10 thresh=1e-6 eprec=1e-9 L=8 qextra=10 h=0.25 tmin=1e-8 tmax_factor=45 dphi=3 inner=3 tolscf=1e-5 rcut=0.75 rtaper=0.075 maxscf=30
ropt_R0.24  nelec=2 state=triplet axial=1 ma=0 mb=-1 E0=203.5 E0b=207.7 ropt=1 maxgeo=10 gtol=2e-3 rtol=1e-4 dr0=0.02 maxstep=0.05 "atoms=1,0,0,-0.12;1,0,0,0.12"
